  "instructions": [
    "Peel and chop the Korean pear into bite-sized pieces.",
    "In a small bowl, mix together the ginger, lemon juice, rice vinegar, sesame oil, honey, and salt.",
    "Place a piece of parchment paper in the bottom of a lacquerware bowl.",
    "Arrange the pear pieces in the bowl, leaving some space between each piece.",
    "Drizzle the ginger mixture over the pears.",
    "Fold the parchment paper over the pears to create a papillote.",
    "Steam the papillote for 10 minutes.",
    "Garnish with chopped parsley.",
    "Serve warm or chilled."
  ],
